WEBVTT

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:08.666
Now I want to show you how to portray the intended dynamic that you have for the piece, using the preparation beat.

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:17.041
So using the preparation beat if a piece starts loud, we're going to give it a big upbeat.

00:00:16.083 --> 00:00:21.583
If it starts softer, piano, we're going to give it a smaller upbeat.

00:00:20.625 --> 00:00:24.375
Sometimes we want to bring our plane higher too, if it's soft.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.083
So lets do a forte, a loud entrance.

00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:35.041
One, two, three, four.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:36.291
It's a big grand upbeat.

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:36.666
Let's try that again.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:41.291
One, two, three, four.

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:43.500
Now let's do a piano entrance, a soft entrance.

00:00:44.458 --> 00:00:48.166
It's a small upbeat.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:52.458
One, two, three, four.

00:00:51.708 --> 00:00:55.666
One, two, three, four.

00:00:55.416 --> 00:01:00.750
Let's try that, sometimes it helps to raise your plane up.

00:01:00.208 --> 00:01:05.916
One, two, three, four.

00:01:05.416 --> 00:01:09.208
If you noticed, my movements are smaller too.

00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:26.958
One, two, three, four.
